.TH ENGINE_REPLACE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
engine_replace \- Queue a swap of the top scene for s: the old scene's on_exit runs, then s is pushed and its on_enter runs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.BI "void engine_replace(Engine *e, Scene *s);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queue a swap of the top scene for s: the old scene's on_exit runs, then s is pushed and its on_enter runs. Use for title \-> game and game \-> game\-over transitions where the old scene should not remain underneath. Equivalent to engine_pop followed by engine_push in the same callback.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_push (3),
.BR engine_pop (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
